    "blurb": "Create and store KPI records",
    "overview": "Collect KPI data from your process instances and save it in a business database. More than 20 functions cover tasks such as finding users who complete tasks, measuring the duration between two tasks, and counting the number of errors thrown during execution.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Turn process instance data into KPI records",
    "splashDescription": "This connector creates a KPI record from the data of a process instance, using more than 20 functions. For example, you can search for users who complete tasks, measure the duration between two tasks, and count the number of errors thrown during execution. You can save the KPI record in a business database, so important business information can be retrieved or calculated and archived.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/873506/overview/img2648084537084740967.png?a0f70d89c7e554895f239baef2fcb92a",
